{
    "title": "Audiobooks.com: Books & More",
    "description": "Are you looking to enjoy your favorite books on the go? The Audiobooks.com app puts over 500,000 classics, bestsellers, and new releases in your pocket, wherever life takes you. Ready to enjoy all the perks of being a member? Sign up in-app today! \u00a0\r\n\r\nWhy not transform your day-to-day routine by escaping into a great story? Stream or download your audiobooks for listening in the car, at the gym, or on any smart speaker. Whether you're in the mood for a thrilling mystery, a cozy romance, or an educational listen, we've got you covered.\r\n\r\nDownload the Audiobooks.com app today to enjoy all of your favorite books without ever having to turn a page!\r\n\r\n\r\nENJOY MEMBERSHIP PERKS\u00a0\r\n\r\nAccessing our vast library has never been easier. With just a few taps, you can explore our extensive collection, enjoy personalized recommendations, and start listening to your favorite titles in no time.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nSign up today to get:\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u2022 Access to our library of over 500,000 audiobooks\r\n\u2022 Your choice of a bonus audiobook monthly from our VIP section\r\n\u2022 Member-exclusive sales and deals\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Unlimited listening to our catalog of free titles \r\n\u2022 Personalized book recommendations\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u2026.and so much more!\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nSo, whether you're a new listener eager to embark on your audiobook journey or an existing member looking to make the most of our latest features, simply download our app, sign up for membership, and let the storytelling begin!\r\n\r\n\r\nEXTENSIVE LIBRARY\r\n\r\nWith top titles from around the world \u2013 and even some otherworldly listens \u2013 we have something for everyone.\r\n\r\nOur library includes:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Over 500,000 audiobooks across all genres\r\n\u2022 Unlimited listening to 10,000+ free titles\r\n\u2022 Audiobooks for all ages\r\n\u2022 Immersive stories, reimagined favorites, and weekly new releases\r\n\u2022 Freshly curated and tailored recommendations for every listener\r\n\r\nDiscover our catalog by exploring top genres and featured booklists. We're constantly curating selections of member favorites, trending topics, TV/Film adaptations, and more. We\u2019ll even give you a list of perfect first listens to start with.\r\n\r\nPlus, the more you engage with the app, the more we offer personalized recommendations to help you find the perfect listen.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nCOMMUNITY\r\n\r\nEngage with fellow book lovers from around the world to share ratings, reviews, and booklist recommendations. Members can also refer a friend in-app to get a free credit when the invitation is accepted.\r\n\r\nKeep listening and engaging with the app to earn achievements like redeeming a VIP Reward, following an author, or reviewing your past listens. There\u2019s always something new to discover with Audiobooks.com.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nHELPFUL FEATURES\r\n\r\nWe aim to make listening easy and accessible for all.\u00a0\r\n\r\nIn-app features include:\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u2022 Adjustable playback speed to customize your listening experience\r\n\u2022 Sleep timers that automatically pause your book once you drift into a dream\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Custom notes to bookmark key moments of your audiobook\r\n\u2022 Save listens to your wishlist for later\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Easy purchasing of additional credits for members\r\n\u2022 Seamless listening through Bluetooth or AirPlay, plus integrated options for CarPlay, Android Auto, Amazon Alexa, and more!\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Intuitive playback controls make it easy to navigate through tracks and pause, play, and skip ahead",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you looking to enjoy your favorite books on the go? The Audiobooks.com app puts over 500,000 classics, bestsellers, and new releases in your pocket, wherever life takes you. Ready to enjoy all the perks of being a member? Sign up in-app today! \u00a0<br><br>Why not transform your day-to-day routine by escaping into a great story? Stream or download your audiobooks for listening in the car, at the gym, or on any smart speaker. Whether you&#39;re in the mood for a thrilling mystery, a cozy romance, or an educational listen, we&#39;ve got you covered.<br><br>Download the Audiobooks.com app today to enjoy all of your favorite books without ever having to turn a page!<br><br><br>ENJOY MEMBERSHIP PERKS\u00a0<br><br>Accessing our vast library has never been easier. With just a few taps, you can explore our extensive collection, enjoy personalized recommendations, and start listening to your favorite titles in no time.\u00a0<br><br><br>Sign up today to get:\u00a0<br><br>\u2022 Access to our library of over 500,000 audiobooks<br>\u2022 Your choice of a bonus audiobook monthly from our VIP section<br>\u2022 Member-exclusive sales and deals\u00a0<br>\u2022 Unlimited listening to our catalog of free titles <br>\u2022 Personalized book recommendations\u00a0<br><br>\u2026.and so much more!\u00a0<br><br><br>So, whether you&#39;re a new listener eager to embark on your audiobook journey or an existing member looking to make the most of our latest features, simply download our app, sign up for membership, and let the storytelling begin!<br><br><br>EXTENSIVE LIBRARY<br><br>With top titles from around the world \u2013 and even some otherworldly listens \u2013 we have something for everyone.<br><br>Our library includes:<br><br>\u2022 Over 500,000 audiobooks across all genres<br>\u2022 Unlimited listening to 10,000+ free titles<br>\u2022 Audiobooks for all ages<br>\u2022 Immersive stories, reimagined favorites, and weekly new releases<br>\u2022 Freshly curated and tailored recommendations for every listener<br><br>Discover our catalog by exploring top genres and featured booklists. We&#39;re constantly curating selections of member favorites, trending topics, TV/Film adaptations, and more. We\u2019ll even give you a list of perfect first listens to start with.<br><br>Plus, the more you engage with the app, the more we offer personalized recommendations to help you find the perfect listen.\u00a0<br><br><br>COMMUNITY<br><br>Engage with fellow book lovers from around the world to share ratings, reviews, and booklist recommendations. Members can also refer a friend in-app to get a free credit when the invitation is accepted.<br><br>Keep listening and engaging with the app to earn achievements like redeeming a VIP Reward, following an author, or reviewing your past listens. There\u2019s always something new to discover with Audiobooks.com.\u00a0<br><br><br>HELPFUL FEATURES<br><br>We aim to make listening easy and accessible for all.\u00a0<br><br>In-app features include:\u00a0<br><br>\u2022 Adjustable playback speed to customize your listening experience<br>\u2022 Sleep timers that automatically pause your book once you drift into a dream\u00a0<br>\u2022 Custom notes to bookmark key moments of your audiobook<br>\u2022 Save listens to your wishlist for later\u00a0<br>\u2022 Easy purchasing of additional credits for members<br>\u2022 Seamless listening through Bluetooth or AirPlay, plus integrated options for CarPlay, Android Auto, Amazon Alexa, and more!\u00a0<br>\u2022 Intuitive playback controls make it easy to navigate through tracks and pause, play, and skip ahead",
